        headlines: ["Glass Pipes Found Among Jewelry at Craft Fair Booth", "Jewelry Seller From Scale Case Faces New Paraphernalia Charge"],
        law: "possParaphernalia",
        spec: "Knowingly possessed drug paraphernalia, glass pipes, with intent to sell, on {DATE}.",
